#10500
The ravenwide chute credits room~
  This is meant to be a huge mob chute to be used to spread mobs all over
The world of ravenmud.  It is compartmentalized and meant to randomly distribute
Mobs to every zone.  The purpose of this is to encourage exploring by
distributing the strange travelers everywhere.  This was written by the player
known as Aggression the Death Knight and Drez the Thief.  Load the 00 object
for this zone for further information.
~
105 1023 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
#10501
The Chute~
  This is the first room of the chute.  This is only room where stuff
loads.  If you are a mortal, and are here, you should immediately go
north, north, south or be summoned out.
~
